# Generated by `node tools/polestar.js profession gathering build` from data/forever and tools/lib/professions/gathering. Do not edit: rebuild with that command.
guide forever/professions/skinning
title Skinning 1-300
category Professions
coords era
levels 5-60
zone Ironforge

# Skinning 1-300 for both factions: loops through the densest skinnable beasts
# of the right level for each skill band, with rank training. Skill needed: 1 for
# level 10 and below, (level-10)x10 for 11-20, level x5 above 20.
# Beast lists per zone are curated (tools/lib/professions/gathering/skinning.js);
# levels and spawns come from npcs.json.
#
# Spawns, trainers and vendors come from the Era baseline (pfQuest); recipes and
# their skill colours from the Forever client tables (`profession build`).
# Nothing confirms the spawns' 10-60 placement on Forever yet: refine with
# Polestar_Recorder sessions. Waypoints are Era-frame (`coords era`); the engine
# converts them where Forever changed a map frame.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Apprentice

step Learn Skinning
  tip Any Skinning trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice Skinning (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest. Buy a Skinning Knife from a trade goods or general vendor: keep it in your bags, you cannot skin without it.
  level 5
  train Skinning Apprentice
  buy 7005 x1 nearest

